                                                <td>
                                                    <p style="line-height: 1.7;">
                                                        3. Please come prepared with the <b style="text-decoration: underline;"> Original documents</b> (required for verification before commencement of Interview. In case of failure to present any of the said documents, you shall not be permitted to attend the Interview)  in respect of eligibility criteria regarding education, year of experience, scale of pay, NOC (if applicable) along with number of photocopy sets (Please note that <b style="text-decoration: underline;">no photocopying support</b> shall be available at the venue of Personal Interview).
                                                    </p><ul style="list-style: lower-alpha;line-height: 1.7;">
                                                        <li>
                                                            Three (3) sets of self-attested photocopies of the above-mentioned ORIGINAL documents. Photocopy of the said documents shall be arranged / sequenced in order given below.
                                                            <ul style="list-style: lower-roman; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6;">
                                                                <li>Declaration Form-I of the Candidate (1 Original + 2 Photocopy: With each Form-I enclose following document in order given below)</li>
                                                                <li>Copy of Online Application Form and Acknowledgement Slip</li>
                                                                <li>Declaration Form-II for SC / ST / OBC / EWS (if applicable)</li>
                                                                <li>SC / ST / OBC / EWS Certificate (if applicable)</li>
                                                                <li>Disability / Discharge Certificate (if applicable)</li>
                                                                <li>10th Class Certificate (with Date of Birth) or School Leaving Certificate</li>
                                                                <li>Graduation Mark Sheet (Semester-wise / Consolidated) and Certificate</li>
                                                                <li>Post-Graduation Mark Sheet (Semester-wise / Consolidated) and Certificate </li>
                                                                <li>Professional / Statutory Qualification / Other qualification – Certificates &amp; Mark Sheet (as applicable)</li>
                                                                <li>Certificate of Specialization duly issued by institute, in case, specialization not mentioned in Mark Statement / Certificate for Graduation / PG / Professional Courses. </li>
                                                                <li>No Objection Certificate from Present Employer (if applicable) and pay slip for last three months.</li>
                                                                <li>Experience Certificate/s (Recent first) towards the year of experience claimed in application form (For all employer with from date &amp; to date and other necessary information establishing relevant area experience).</li>
                                                                <li>Photo Identification Card (Voters / Driving License / PAN / Aadhar / Passport)</li>
                                                            </ul>
                                                        </li>
                                                        <li>Three (3) sets of the above listed documents, arranged in given order along with your passport-size photographs 2 (two) nos.</li>
                                                        <li>Additional 3 sets of the Declaration Form-I (photocopy) may also be required to be submitted by the applicant.</li>
                                                        <li>Two (2) copies of enclosed Form-III for claiming TA and copy of travel tickets.</li>
                                                        <li>In case a course of study offers dual specialization, i.e., one in major discipline and another in minor discipline, the candidature of the applicant would be considerable only in the discipline of major specialization.</li>

                                                    </ul>
                                                    <p></p>

