                                                            </tbody>
                                                        </table>







                                                        <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                                                            <b>The reimbursement towards to and fro journey shall be entertained only if the candidate has actually been Interviewed. Please ensure that all documents detailed in Para (3) above, in requisite number of sets as mentioned therein, are submitted to ensure participation in the Interview. </b>
                                                        </li>
                                                        <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                                                            No reimbursement of travelling expenses shall be made if a candidate is provisionally allowed to appear at the Interview, for any reason whatsoever.
                                                        </li>
                                                        <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                                                            The settlement of reimbursement of travelling expenses will be made by bank transfer, accordingly candidate is requested to submit bank account details in the prescribed bank mandate form (enclosed) along with photo copy of the cheque / bank passbook.


                                                        </li>








                                                    </ul>

                                                    <p style="line-height: 1.7;">5. You are advised to come prepared to stay for one more day besides the day of Interview, if required. You shall make your own arrangement for your stay in Kolkata.</p>
                                                    <p style="line-height: 1.7;">6. In case of variation in name / surname / name spelling mentioned in the application with that in the respective certificates pertaining to Qualification / Caste, etc., the applicant shall be required to submit an affidavit sworn-in before a First-Class Judicial Magistrate / appropriate authority to this effect along with the respective documents at the time of interview failing which the candidature shall be cancelled.</p>
                                                    <p style="line-height: 1.7;">7. <b>Please present a copy of this letter at the time of Interview.</b> </p>
                                                    <p style="line-height: 1.7;">
                                                        8. Please note that:
                                                    </p><ul style="list-style: lower-latin;">
                                                        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><b>MERE INVITATION TO ATTEND THE INTERVIEW SHALL NOT CONFER ANY LEGAL RIGHT / CLAIM FOR EMPLOYMENT IN HINDUSTAN COPPER LIMITED.</b></li>
                                                        <li><b>YOUR SHORTLISTING FOR THE INTERVIEW IS BASED ON THE FACTS / STATEMENTS PROVIDED BY YOU IN YOUR ONLINE APPLICATION. IF ANY OF THE SAID DETAIL IS FOUND TO BE MATERIALLY WRONG OR INCORRECT OR MISLEADING, YOUR CANDIDATURE SHALL BE LIABLE TO BE CANCELLED AT ANY STAGE OF THE RECRUITMENT PROCESS OR AFTER SELECTION NOTWITHSTANDING YOUR ATTENDING THE INTERVIEW.</b></li>
                                                    </ul>
                                                    <p></p>
                                                    <p style="line-height: 1.7;">9. You are therefore advised to, in your own interest to check, confirm and ensure that you meet the prescribed eligibility criteria for the post applied by you as detailed in the advertisement before presenting yourself for the interview. You must also ensure that all requisite documents and copies thereof as detailed above are made available for submission and verification prior to the interview. Please note that failure on either of these counts shall render you ineligible to attend the interview and no communication in this regard shall be entertained by the Company.</p>
                                                    <p style="line-height: 1.7;">10. You are advised to reach the Interview venue well in time. <span>Kindly confirm your participation in the interview by written email before <b>11/09/2023</b> by mentioning your name and applied post details.</span></p>
                                                    <p style="line-height: 1.7;">We wish you all the best for your Interview.</p>
                                                    <p style="line-height: 1.7;">This issues with the approval of the Competent Authority.</p>



